{"title": "US Announces Landmark Nuclear Deal With Saudi Arabia", "summary": "The US government announced a civilian nuclear cooperation deal with Saudi Arabia on Wednesday. The deal was reached after negotiations between the two countries, and it aims to promote peaceful use of nuclear energy in the region. The agreement includes provisions for the sharing of nuclear technology and materials, as well as safety and security measures. The US Department of Energy said the deal would help reduce the risk of nuclear proliferation in the Middle East. Saudi Arabia's King Salman confirmed the agreement, stating that it would enhance his country's ability to generate electricity and meet its energy needs.", "summary_points": ["The US government announced a civilian nuclear cooperation deal with Saudi Arabia on Wednesday.", "The deal was reached after negotiations between the two countries.", "The agreement includes provisions for the sharing of nuclear technology and materials, as well as safety and security measures.", "Saudi Arabia's King Salman confirmed the agreement, stating that it would enhance his country's ability to generate electricity and meet its energy needs."], "title_hi": "सऊदी अरब के साथ न्यूक्लियर सहयोग समझौता अमेरिका ने घोषित किया", "summary_hi": "अमेरिकी सरकार ने सऊदी अरब के साथ न्यूक्लियर सहयोग समझौता घोषणा किया। इस समझौते में दोनों देशों के बीच विवाद है, और यह समझौता शांतिपूर्ण ऊर्जा के उपयोग को बढ़ावा देने के लिए बनाया गया है। इस समझौते में न्यूक्लियर प्रौद्योगिकी और सामग्रियों के साझेदारी, सुरक्षा और सुरक्षा उपायों सहित विभिन्न प्रदान किए गए हैं।", "summary_points_hi": ["अमेरिकी सरकार ने सऊदी अरब के साथ न्यूक्लियर सहयोग समझौता घोषणा किया।", "इस समझौते में दोनों देशों के बीच विवाद है।", "यह समझौता शांतिपूर्ण ऊर्जा के उपयोग को बढ़ावा देने के लिए बनाया गया है।", "इस समझौते में न्यूक्लियर प्रौद्योगिकी और सामग्रियों के साझेदारी, सुरक्षा और सुरक्षा उपायों सहित विभिन्न प्रदान किए गए हैं।"], "framing": {"right": "Right-leaning outlets focused on the economic